# Layering

Stack folders: `backend` / `frontend` / `packages`. **This file wins on "where does this concern belong?"**

## Package graph

```text
apps/web           ──► packages/shared     # cross-app policy/types (no ORM)
apps/backend       ──► packages/shared     # auth policy SSOT
apps/backend       ──► packages/db         # Drizzle schema (Better Auth + app tables)
@elynd/shared                              # NO apps / ORM / secrets
@elynd/db                                  # schema only — no HTTP
```

| Forbidden |
| --- |
| `apps/web` ↔ `apps/backend` app-source imports |
| Business workflows inside `@elynd/shared` |
| Drizzle/Better Auth tables outside `packages/db` |
| One file mixing HTTP-server and UI-render |

Root tooling (`tsconfig.base.json`, prettier, eslint) is not a package; Next/Hono TS options stay per app.

## Concern → layer

| Concern | Lives in | Must not |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Domain workflow | `apps/backend` modules, `apps/web/features/**` | Generic `lib/`, shared config pkgs |
| Tech capability (no domain) | `apps/backend/src/lib`, middleware | Import feature modules |
| Transport cross-cutting | API middleware / web proxy | Domain workflows |
| Cross-app Zod/DTO/constants (2+ apps) | `@elynd/shared` | Dup schemas; ORM imports |
| Persistence schema | `packages/db` (Drizzle) | Ad-hoc tables in web/shared/backend |
| Server/remote state | Query/data layer | Zustand as API SoT |
| Client UI state | UI store | Secrets; server lists as SoT |
| Design-system atoms | `components/ui/**` | Feature rules |

In-app (Hono): `routes → modules/route → modules/service → lib/db → I/O`. No upward imports. No extra tiers (repository/use-case/facade) without concrete pain.

## Cross-layer propagation (HARD)

Downstream only; typecheck each layer before the next:

- **Hono path:** `packages/db` → `apps/backend` (+ `@elynd/shared` when public) → `apps/web`

| Trigger | Order |
| --- | --- |
| DB schema | `packages/db` migrate → backend → tests → web |
| Shared validator/type | shared → backend + web |
| API response shape | backend (+tests) → shared if public → web → UI |
| Shared constant | define once in owner / `@elynd/shared`; import |

Never update only one layer. Same-fact copies: SSOT in `core`.

## Constants

Literal in **2+** modules → named constant in owning package (or `@elynd/shared` if cross-app). One-off → local. Prefer `as const` over `enum`.
